        "C. \\({\\log _a}\\left( {{a^3}{b^2}} \\right) = \\frac{3}{2} + {\\log _a}b\\).",
        "D. \\({\\log _a}\\left( {{a^3}{b^2}} \\right) = \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{2}{\\log _a}b\\)."
